OL,3,GNEWSARAF Scampton redevelopment bid
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe company behind a plan to redevelop
OL,7,Fa former RAF base near Lincoln says its
OL,8,Fbid to buy the site has been rejected.
OL,10,FScampton Holdings Ltd submitted a joint
OL,11,Fbid with West Lindsey District Council
OL,12,F(WLDC) to buy RAF Scampton from the
OL,13,FHome Office.
OL,15,FCompany chairman Peter Hewitt said they
OL,16,Freceived notification "about a week
OL,17,Fago" and is "very disappointed and
OL,18,Fconcerned about the future of the
OL,19,Fsite".
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
