OL,3,GNEWSARAF Scampton redevelopment bid
OL,4,Arejected
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is understood the Home Office has
OL,7,Fchosen to sell the site to a company in
OL,8,Fthe defence sector, according to the
OL,9,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service. The
OL,10,FBBC has contacted the Home Office for a
OL,11,Fcomment.
